[al:新概念英语第二册]
[ti:39. Am I All Right]
[00:00.720] Passage 39 | 文章三十九
[00:03.270] Am I all right? | 我没事吧？
[00:06.410] While John Gilbert was in hospital, | 约翰·吉尔伯特住院期间，
[00:10.255] he asked his doctor to tell him whether his operation had been successful. | 他问医生，他的手术是否成功。
[00:15.28] But the doctor refused to do so. | 但医生拒绝告知。
[00:19.335] The following day, the patient asked for a bedside telephone. | 第二天，病人要求一个床头电话。
[00:25.38] When he was alone, | 当他独自一人时，
[00:27.820] he telephoned the hospital exchange | 他打电话到医院总机
[00:30.855] and asked for Dr. Millington. | 并要求找米林顿医生。
[00:34.04] When the doctor answered the phone, | 当医生接听电话时，
[00:37.340] Mr. Gilbert said he was inquiring about a certain patient, | 吉尔伯特先生说他正在询问一位病人，
[00:41.660] a Mr. John Gilbert. | 一位名叫约翰·吉尔伯特的先生。
[00:44.320] He asked if Mr. Gilbert's operation had been successful, | 他问吉尔伯特先生的手术是否成功，
[00:48.575] and the doctor told him that it had been. | 医生告诉他手术很成功。
[00:52.475] He then asked when Mr. Gilbert would be allowed to go home, | 然后他问吉尔伯特先生何时可以回家，
[00:57.770] and the doctor told him that he would have to stay in hospital | 医生告诉他，他将不得不继续住院
[01:01.59] for another two weeks. | 再住两周。
[01:04.250] Then Dr. Millington asked the caller if he was a relative of the patient. | 然后米林顿医生问打电话的人他是否是病人的亲属。
[01:11.04] "No," the patient answered. | “不，”病人回答。
[01:14.490] "I am Mr. John Gilbert." | “我就是约翰·吉尔伯特先生。”